text @[Nagisa]
text I'm sorry for just speaking to you despite you being so tired.
text Damn it.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, it's not a problem in the slightest. I'm happy to listen to whatever.
sound MD3.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text No, I think listening to me would be tiring too.
