text Thank you very much.
sound MD6.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text In either case, let's go to bed early today.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text I merely nod, not putting up any argument.
text I hope I get to talk to Nagisa more tomorrow.
