text @[Yoshino]
text Don't shake. Stay still. What are you, a weak little boy?
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm... not a child.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text While I deny the accusation, it is true that my broken-down shoulder is holding me back.
text While I know my shoulder will never fully recover, I foolishly thought that my injury wouldn't be a problem when it came to a bit of physical labor.
text But in reality, I'm not going to get any faster if I'm busy trying to protect my right shoulder.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS11H"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGYS11H.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound MD9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Take the case off. I'll take care of the film.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I climb up the ladder and attempt to remove the outdoors box stuck to the utility pole.
sound MDA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Are you stupid? There's no way your left hand will reach that.
text I hear Yoshino-san's jeers come at me from below.
text I think it's stupid too. After all, I can get to the box just by reaching out with my right hand.
sound MDB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Use both of your hands.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, I can do it fine like this.
sound MDC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...What did you just say?
text The tone of Yoshino-san's voice changes. This is bad.
sound MDD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Get down from there. Right now.
text He's really pissed off now.
bgload KURO.jpg 55
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS10"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGYS10.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound MDE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Why are you moving like that? It's completely impractical.
text @[Tomoya]
text No, it's easier for me to work that way.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS16"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGYS16.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text "Is that so," Yoshino-san mumbles. After that, he says nothing.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
