text With the day's work over, I sit down in the truck's passenger's seat.
music BGM08D.mp3
sound MDF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Okazaki.
text Yoshino-san speaks to me before he ignites the engine.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Yes, what is it?
sound MDG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Let me ask you one more time. Is that way really easier for you?
text The question comes out of nowhere, so I'm at a loss as to how to answer.
sound MDH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Well, is it?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Yes, I like that way better. I'm only speaking for myself, of course.
text Yoshino-san glances at me for a moment before turning his head straight forward again.
sound MDI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...You're not doing anything out of order, so it's fine if you do it that way.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound MDJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Just don't get hurt, okay?
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, okay!
text Just as I reply, I hear the car engine moan into action.
